"Which storage holds this folder. Provider modules add their entry here."
msgstr ""
"Qual armazenamento guarda esta pasta. Os módulos de provedor acrescentam sua"
" entrada aqui."

#. module: liber_cloud_files
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:liber_cloud_files.field_liber_cloud_account__provider
